 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's fuel imports in 2025 were 2.23 billion euros in total.",
  "The largest supplier was Belgium, providing 1.12 billion euros or 50.3% of the imports.",
  "Germany and the Netherlands were the second and third largest suppliers, with 143.5 million euros and 68.8 million euros respectively, making up 6.4% and 3.1%.",
  "A significant share, 39.3%, of the imports came from undisclosed partners and is not attributed to any specific country.",
  "The data is in current euros and includes a large portion of imports from undisclosed sources, which limits detailed country-level analysis."
 ],
